<title>USA: ReSound says CFO Paul Busse to leave firm.</title>
<headline>ReSound says CFO Paul Busse to leave firm.</headline>
<dateline>REDWOOD CITY, Calif. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>ReSound Corp said its chief financial officer Paul Busse will leave the company to relocate to the Pacific Northwest and pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Busse will remain with the company until a successor is found, ReSound added.</p>
<p>ReSound said Busse's move is unrelated to the company's fourth-quarter earnings results.</p>
<p>The company said Thursday it lost $0.18 per share for the quarter, compared with a loss of $0.01 per share.</p>
